"The Studio workspace in installed XTimers, showing simulated Design, Research, Writing, Reading and Planning timers, Focus sprint, and three world clocks on a navy background" = "インストール済みXTimersの「Studio」ワークスペース。サンプルの「Design」「Research」「Writing」「Reading」「Planning」のタイマー、「Focus sprint」、3つの世界時計をネイビーの背景で表示";
